#: ../../tools/sra_tools.rst:32 683cbf82bc50471da1ce808b43ec6b83
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get detailed metadata for a specific SRA experiment by "
"accession number. Returns experiment title, organism, sequencing "
"platform, library information, study details, and run statistics. Accepts"
" SRA experiment accessions (SRX/ERX/DRX), study accessions (SRP/ERP/DRP),"
" or sample accessions (SRS/ERS/DRS)."
msgstr ""

